{"seq":1,"slug":"monad-functor-applicative","title":"Monad、Functor 与 Applicative 组合子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/patterns/monad-functor-applicative","wordCount":760,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"monad-functor-与-applicative-组合子\">Monad、Functor 与 Applicative 组合子</h1><p>Monad 不是什么神秘的数学概念——它是一种<strong>组合模式</strong>。当你需要将多个可能失败的计算链接起来、将多个异步操作按顺序执行、或者在每一步之间传递隐含的上下文时，你需要的正是 Monad 提供的组合能力。连同 Functor 和 Applicative，三者构成了函数式编程中处理「带上下文的计算」的统一框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Functor、Applicative、Monad 是三个递进的抽象层，解决同一类问题：如何在「带上下文的值」（可能为空、可能失败、可能异步、可能有多个）上进行计算。Functor 处理单步变换，Applicative 处理独立计算的合并，Monad 处理依赖前一步结果的链式计算。三者形成一个层次——每个 Monad 也是 Applicative，每个 Applicative 也是 Functor。</p>\n<h2 id=\"functor-在容器内做变换\">Functor：在容器内做变换</h2><p>Functor 是最基础的抽象——它表示「可以在不改变外层结构的前提下，对内部值做变换」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Functor f where&#10;  fmap :: (a -&gt; b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Functor f where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fmap :: (a -> b) -> f a -> f b</span></span></code></pre></div><p>直觉：<code>fmap</code> 就是在容器内部应用一个函数，容器本身的形状不变。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// List 是 Functor&#10;[1, 2, 3].map((x) =&gt; x * 2); // [2, 4, 6]&#10;&#10;// Option 是 Functor&#10;Some(5).map((x) =&gt; x + 1); // Some(6)&#10;None.map((x) =&gt; x + 1); // None — 结构不变&#10;&#10;// Promise 是 Functor&#10;fetch(url).then((resp) =&gt; resp.json()); // 在异步容器内变换\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// List 是 Functor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [2, 4, 6]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Option 是 Functor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Some(6)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">None.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// None — 结构不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Promise 是 Functor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在异步容器内变换</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Functor 法则保证 <code>fmap</code> 的行为符合直觉：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fmap</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>id</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>id</mtext><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>fmap</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>fmap</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>∘</mo><mtext>fmap</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fmap}\\; \\text{id} = \\text{id} \\qquad \\text{fmap}\\; (g \\circ h) = \\text{fmap}\\; g \\circ \\text{fmap}\\; h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fmap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    FA[F[A]&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;fmap f&quot;| FB[F[B]&quot;]&#10;    FB --&gt;|&quot;fmap g&quot;| FC[F[C]&quot;]&#10;    FA --&gt;|&quot;fmap (g∘f)&quot;| FC\">graph LR\n    FA[F[A]\"] --&gt;|\"fmap f\"| FB[F[B]\"]\n    FB --&gt;|\"fmap g\"| FC[F[C]\"]\n    FA --&gt;|\"fmap (g∘f)\"| FC</pre><h2 id=\"applicative-独立计算的组合\">Applicative：独立计算的组合</h2><p>Applicative 在 Functor 之上增加了两个能力：将纯值放入容器（<code>pure</code>），以及将「容器中的函数」应用于「容器中的值」（<code>&lt;*&gt;</code>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Functor f =&gt; Applicative f where&#10;  pure  :: a -&gt; f a&#10;  (&lt;*&gt;) :: f (a -&gt; b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Functor f => Applicative f where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pure  :: a -> f a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (&#x3C;*>) :: f (a -> b) -> f a -> f b</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Applicative 的关键特征：多个计算之间<strong>互不依赖</strong>——它们可以独立执行后合并结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 验证场景：三个校验独立执行，收集所有错误&#10;const validateName = (name: string): Validated&lt;string, string&gt; =&gt; ...&#10;const validateAge = (age: number): Validated&lt;string, number&gt; =&gt; ...&#10;const validateEmail = (email: string): Validated&lt;string, string&gt; =&gt; ...&#10;&#10;// Applicative 组合：所有错误同时收集&#10;const result = Validated.map3(&#10;  validateName(input.name),&#10;  validateAge(input.age),&#10;  validateEmail(input.email),&#10;  (name, age, email) =&gt; ({ name, age, email })&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 验证场景：三个校验独立执行，收集所有错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Validated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateAge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Validated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateEmail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Validated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Applicative 组合：所有错误同时收集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Validated.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  validateName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  validateAge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.age),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  validateEmail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.email),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">age</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ name, age, email })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Functor</th>\n<th>Applicative</th>\n<th>Monad</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心操作</td>\n<td><code>fmap</code></td>\n<td><code>pure</code> + <code>&lt;*&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>&gt;&gt;=</code> (flatMap)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算关系</td>\n<td>单一变换</td>\n<td>独立计算合并</td>\n<td>依赖链式计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行潜力</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>可并行</td>\n<td>必须顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误累积</td>\n<td>遇错停止</td>\n<td>可累积所有错误</td>\n<td>遇错停止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>映射</td>\n<td>表单验证、并行IO</td>\n<td>链式异步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"monad-依赖前一步结果的计算链\">Monad：依赖前一步结果的计算链</h2><p>Monad 在 Applicative 之上增加了 <code>flatMap</code>（Haskell 中写作 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code>）：下一步计算可以<strong>依赖前一步的结果</strong>来决定做什么。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Applicative m =&gt; Monad m where&#10;  (&gt;&gt;=) :: m a -&gt; (a -&gt; m b) -&gt; m b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Applicative m => Monad m where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (>>=) :: m a -> (a -> m b) -> m b</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Maybe/Option Monad：链式空值处理&#10;function getStreetName(user: User): Option&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  return getAddress(user) // Option&lt;Address&gt;&#10;    .flatMap(getCity) // Option&lt;City&gt; — 依赖 address&#10;    .flatMap(getStreet) // Option&lt;Street&gt; — 依赖 city&#10;    .map((street) =&gt; street.name);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 如果任何一步返回 None，整个链路短路返回 None\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Maybe/Option Monad：链式空值处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getStreetName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Option&#x3C;Address></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(getCity) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Option&#x3C;City> — 依赖 address</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(getStreet) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Option&#x3C;Street> — 依赖 city</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">street</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> street.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 如果任何一步返回 None，整个链路短路返回 None</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Monad 三法则保证 <code>flatMap</code> 的结合性和 <code>pure</code> 的中性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>pure</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>left identity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pure}\\; a \\gg\\!= f \\equiv f\\; a \\quad (\\text{left identity})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pure</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">left identity</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>pure</mtext><mo>≡</mo><mi>m</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>right identity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\gg\\!= \\text{pure} \\equiv m \\quad (\\text{right identity})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6582em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pure</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">right identity</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>≫</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>associativity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(m \\gg\\!= f) \\gg\\!= g \\equiv m \\gg\\!= (\\lambda x.\\; f\\; x \\gg\\!= g) \\quad (\\text{associativity})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6582em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">associativity</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"do-notation-与-for-comprehension\">do-notation 与 for-comprehension</h2><p>Monad 的链式 <code>flatMap</code> 可以用语法糖简化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Haskell do-notation&#10;main :: IO ()&#10;main = do&#10;  name &lt;- getLine           -- getLine &gt;&gt;= \\name -&gt;&#10;  putStrLn (&quot;Hello &quot; ++ name)&#10;&#10;-- 等价的 desugared 版本&#10;main = getLine &gt;&gt;= \\name -&gt; putStrLn (&quot;Hello &quot; ++ name)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Haskell do-notation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>main :: IO ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>main = do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name &#x3C;- getLine           -- getLine >>= \\name -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  putStrLn (\"Hello \" ++ name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 等价的 desugared 版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>main = getLine >>= \\name -> putStrLn (\"Hello \" ++ name)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"// Scala for-comprehension&#10;for {&#10;  user    &lt;- getUser(id)         // flatMap&#10;  address &lt;- getAddress(user)    // flatMap&#10;  city    &lt;- getCity(address)    // map (最后一步)&#10;} yield city.name\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Scala for-comprehension</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user    &#x3C;- getUser(id)         // flatMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  address &#x3C;- getAddress(user)    // flatMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  city    &#x3C;- getCity(address)    // map (最后一步)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} yield city.name</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见-monad-实例\">常见 Monad 实例</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    M[Monad 实例]&#10;    M --&gt; Maybe[&quot;Option/Maybe: 空值处理&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; Either[&quot;Either/Result: 错误处理&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; IO[&quot;IO: 副作用描述&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; List[&quot;List: 非确定性计算&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; State[&quot;State: 隐式状态传递&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; Reader[&quot;Reader: 依赖注入&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; Writer[&quot;Writer: 日志累积&quot;]\">graph TD\n    M[Monad 实例]\n    M --&gt; Maybe[\"Option/Maybe: 空值处理\"]\n    M --&gt; Either[\"Either/Result: 错误处理\"]\n    M --&gt; IO[\"IO: 副作用描述\"]\n    M --&gt; List[\"List: 非确定性计算\"]\n    M --&gt; State[\"State: 隐式状态传递\"]\n    M --&gt; Reader[\"Reader: 依赖注入\"]\n    M --&gt; Writer[\"Writer: 日志累积\"]</pre><p>每种 Monad 为 <code>flatMap</code> 赋予不同的「额外行为」：Option 自动传播空值、Either 自动传播错误、State 自动线程状态、Reader 自动传递环境。代码逻辑不变，组合子模式自动处理「管道」中的杂务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Functor 在容器内做变换而不改变结构</li>\n<li>Applicative 组合独立计算，支持错误累积和并行</li>\n<li>Monad 通过 flatMap 实现依赖链式计算</li>\n<li>do-notation / for-comprehension 是 Monad 的语法糖</li>\n<li>不同 Monad 实例为同一组合模式赋予不同的「额外行为」</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"effect-systems\">Effect System 与类型化副作用</a> — Monad 思想在副作用管理中的工业级应用</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/monads\">Haskell hub：Monad</a> — Monad 在纯函数式语言中的完整生态</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Monad、Functor 与 Applicative 组合子","id":"monad-functor-与-applicative-组合子"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Functor：在容器内做变换","id":"functor-在容器内做变换"},{"level":2,"text":"Applicative：独立计算的组合","id":"applicative-独立计算的组合"},{"level":2,"text":"Monad：依赖前一步结果的计算链","id":"monad-依赖前一步结果的计算链"},{"level":2,"text":"do-notation 与 for-comprehension","id":"do-notation-与-for-comprehension"},{"level":2,"text":"常见 Monad 实例","id":"常见-monad-实例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"高阶类型与 Typeclass","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/type-systems/higher-kinded-types-typeclasses"},"next":{"title":"Effect System 与类型化副作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/patterns/effect-systems"}}